Error [jet.MarkerArgumentMismatch]: `#App.Public` arguments do not match `App.Public(limit: Int{…}, per: Duration{…})`
  --> tests/ui/app_marker_argument_mismatch_reports_alone.jet:9:6
    |
  9 |     #App.Public(limit: "many") status: fn(self) -> String { "{self.name} is up" }
    |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Marker arguments use the same call grammar and typed signature as function arguments
 Fix: Match the declared signature `App.Public(limit: Int{…}, per: Duration{…})`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0930
